Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：贝西·伯恩斯）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.65,0:02:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}奶油  蛋  面粉 莱姆和奇异果…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I don't know. Um, butter and eggs and flour and lime and kiwi...{\r}
