Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你说这是柠檬派{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You said it was a key lime pie.{\r}
