Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.39,0:03:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}去穿外套  我们去医院{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Get your coat. We'll to the hospital. Uh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.14,0:03:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他会没事吗   他得打针{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Will he be okay?  He's gotta get a shot.{\r}
